        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "media": {
            "duration": 4722,
            "fileSize": 76368696
          },
          "author": "Tumble Media",
          "description": "Prepare for a giggle-filled exploration into the gross side of science! From the peculiar habits of our favorite dinosaurs to the surprising ways trees communicate, this card answers the funniest questions about nature. \n\nFind out what it means to be a poop collector and if dinosaurs really did burp! Plus, we’ll explore the fascinating (and sometimes stinky) science behind animal mummies and the curious science of butts. \n\nJoin us for an unforgettable adventure where science meets the animal kingdom, perfect for curious minds eager to learn and laugh! ",
